# SSH keys allowed to sign the local model catalog (basecamp/omarchy-local-ai).
# `omarchy agent local` accepts a catalog commit only when `git verify-commit` finds its signature
# here, so anyone listed is a software publisher for every machine running a local model.
# Format (ssh-keygen ALLOWED SIGNERS): <principal> namespaces="git" <key type> <public key>
# Revoke a key by removing its line; commits it signed stop being accepted as new catalog tips.
